## Authentication
Session Token (x-ebay-c-correlation-session) — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /signin/sub/tt.html` — Initiate the eBay sign-in process.

### Data Read (4)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve details for a specific eBay item by ID.
- `GET /customer/v1/bs_img_service` — Retrieve an image from eBay's image service.
- `GET /gh/useracquisition` — Retrieve user acquisition related data.
- `GET /ifh/inflowcomponent` — Retrieve data for an inflow component.

### Data Write (1)
- `POST /tkt/publish/v2/demand` — Publish a demand ticket.

### Search (1)
- `GET /sch/ajax/autocomplete` — Get autocomplete suggestions for search queries.

### Config (1)
- `GET /config/com/{comId}.json` — Fetch configuration data for a specific eBay community.

